          "profileName": "Yinka W",
          "createdAt": "2025-12-05",
          "starRatings": 5,
          "reviewDetails": "I accompanied the team from Decorex in South Africa on a guided tour of Freedom Park. I did add more knowledge to the historical account of the Park which I assumed that I already knew to an extent during this tour. I had visited the museum, the amphitheater, the preserved cells and all other parts of park over the years and I am very proud to see that the entire facility has taken shape and have emerged into a brilliant centre of learning that Nigeria is proud of. My favourite spot was the fish pond. I will recommend that Nigerians should endeavour to visit with family and friends often and take their visitors for the diverse enriching experience. Students at all levels will love it. Of course Detty December here will be fun.",
